heta) - EqR\\sin \\theta = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{C}^{2} - E_{\\mathrm{kB}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{C}} = \\sqrt{gR}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(整段动能定理算对也给分)\n(2)等效重力等于电场力和重力的合力大小为1.25mg，恰好做完整的圆周运动时，在等效最高点处有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{mv_{\\min}^{2}}{R}=1.25mg"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n从等效最高点到等效最低点使用动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"1.25mg \\cdot 2R=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\max}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\min}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\max}=\\frac{5}{2}\\sqrt{gR}"},{"type":"text","value":"弹力和等效重力提供所需向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}-1.25mg=\\frac{mv_{\\max}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=\\frac{15}{2}mg"},{"type":"text","value":"根据牛顿第三定律可得，滑块对竖直圆轨道的最大弹力大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{15}{2}mg"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)①能过圆轨道"},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":"段合外力做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{BC}=mgR(1-\\cos\\theta)-Eq\\sin\\theta=-\\frac{1}{4}mgR"},{"type":"text","value":"不脱离竖直圆轨道需要到达B点的满足"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B}\\geq\\frac{5\\sqrt{5}}{4}gR"},{"type":"text","value":"因此"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{k0}} = E_{\\mathrm{kB}} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_B^2\\geq \\frac{25}{8} mgR"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n②能过半圆弯道最左侧\nCD 段合外力做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{CD} = -\\mu mg \\cdot 2R - Eq \\cdot 2R = -\\frac{5}{2} mg R"},{"type":"text","value":"DF 段不脱离时，在圆轨道最左侧处电场力和轨道支持力一起提供所需向心力，"},{"type":"math","value":"Eq \\leq \\frac{mv^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"同时滑块到最左侧时，动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{BC} + W_{CD} - Eq\\cdot R = \\frac{1}{2} mv^2 -E_{\\mathrm{k0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{k0}} \\geq \\frac{31}{8} mgR"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n②反弹后不进入半圆弯道\n从 F 到 G 再反弹回 F，外力做功为"},{"type":"math","value":"W _ {F G F} = - \\mu m g \\cdot 2 R \\times 2 = - 2 m g R"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"到经反弹回"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{BC} + W_{CD} + W_{FGF} = 0 - E_{\\mathrm{k0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k0}\\leq\\frac{19}{4}mgR"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(整段动能定理算对也给分)\n综上得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{31}{8} mgR \\leq E_{\\mathrm{k0}} \\leq \\frac{19}{4} mgR"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q17","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2608","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"033c4e267985be7b2ea4dcc764ef676ba95d359ede6f20db5683ab3e63e3fa68","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(12分)图甲是简单的直流电动机模型示意图,固定部分为一对磁极和圆柱形铁芯,它们之间的磁场可认为沿径向分布;旋转部分为单匝矩形导线框abcd,能绕轴心线 "},{"type":"math","value":"OO'"},{"type":"text","value":" 转动,线框无论转到什么位置,线框平面都跟图乙中的磁感线平行,线框的ab、cd边所处位置的磁感应强度大小处处为B.线框通过换向器与直流电源连接.已知ab、cd边的质量均为M、长度均为L,其他部分质量不计,线框总电阻为R.电源电动势为E,内阻为r.当闭合开关S,线框由静止开始在磁场中转动,忽略一切摩擦以及线圈的自感系数.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/53389cca5c4b50b528fbd3dd5ff648811392c39260df38ceeb3280a3536e1ba7.png","width":838,"height":509,"width_mm":98.49,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q17-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a674c7ac70b2cda3a9034efdc182110fb59d429c2de7f87f93fd928d7136aed0.png","width":283,"height":423,"width_mm":33.18,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n乙\n(1)求刚闭合开关 S 瞬间,线框中的电流 I;\n(2)求闭合开关后,线框由静止开始转动到转动速率达到稳定的过程中,线框 ab 边能达到的最大速率 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和电源所释放的电能 W;\n(3)当用电动机带动其他机器稳定工作时,线框的 ab、cd 边相当于都受到与转动速度方向相反、大小恒定的阻力 f. 写出此时电动机工作效率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的表达式."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(12分)(1)根据闭合回路欧姆定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R+r}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n(2)线框受到的安培力为动力,不断加速,直至线框切割磁场产生的感应电动势(反电动势)和电源电动势大小相等时,电流为0,安培力为0,转动速率达到稳定"},{"type":"math","value":"E=E_{\\text{反}}=2BLv_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=\\frac{E}{2BL}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n对线框动量定理:"},{"type":"math","value":"2B\\bar{I}Lt=2Mv_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n而"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\bar{I}t"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\frac{Mv_{m}}{BL}"},{"type":"text","value":"电源释放的电能 W=qE (1 分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"W=\\frac{ME^{2}}{2B^{2}L^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(3)根据题意,线框稳定工作时"},{"type":"math","value":"f=F_{\\text{安}}=BIL"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{f}{BL}"},{"type":"text","value":"此时,线框转动,仍有感应电动势(反电动势)"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\text{反}}=2BLv"},{"type":"text","value":"闭合回路:"},{"type":"math","value":"E-E_{\\text{反}}=I(R+r)"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n工作效率"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta=\\frac{P_{\\text{机}}}{P_{\\text{电}}}=\\frac{2F_{\\text{安}}v}{UI}=\\frac{2BILv}{UI}=\\frac{E_{\\text{反}}}{U}=\\frac{E-\\frac{f}{BL}(R+r)}{E-Ir}=\\frac{EBL-f(R+r)}{EBL-fr}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2 分)\n(其它方法解得正确答案也给分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--qiangji-lianmeng-2608","source_question_id":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bf6b442476b03be665cc479f2993547edbd05cd59df3740f8b4b4571bd40053c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(12分)“彭宁离子阱”是可以用来储存带电粒子的装置,其结构主要由一个旋转对称的环电极和上下两个相同的端电极组成.如图(a)所示,以阱中心为坐标原点O,旋转对称轴为z轴,建立空间坐标系.在环电极和端电极间加电压,阱内形成电场,纵截面的部分电场线和等势线分布如图(b)所示.为研究问题方便,阱内电场分解为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{xy}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{z}"},{"type":"text","value":" 两部分:电场 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{xy}"},{"type":"text","value":" 在垂直z轴平面(即平行xOy平面)内,以z轴为中心的水平径向电场,同一圆周电场强度大小相等,方向如图(c)所示;电场 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{z}"},{"type":"text","value":" 平行z轴,如图(d)所示,其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{z}=-\\lambda z"},{"type":"text","value":" .质量为m、电荷量为+q的氢离子被束缚在阱内运动,忽略重力、阻力、相对论效应和辐射.(简谐运动的周期公式 "},{"type":"math","value":"T=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,k为回复力系数)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b092e594d424f05e0acd61a8bee1bdedc499871164bd964f04272662b840a280.png","width":324,"height":281,"width_mm":38.01,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(a)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fc08c406a11eddd66cb11f4f26c7ac069dcf67da2c993c8c14ab7ecd04387218.png","width":265,"height":282,"width_mm":31.08,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(b)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3954a5dbc2f1cb870878d909f14a96b77b3eb0e23c4c486fad12b955d416446a.png","width":221,"height":231,"width_mm":25.83,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(c)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0a088a2515edd94565b3712c8c3a5d848ee8911681499b2f459879c19ee854cc.png","width":262,"height":261,"width_mm":30.66,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(d)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1a5690e68254d15fe276b9454dd7588c76433d2074998ea06aa4366411566eaf.png","width":276,"height":251,"width_mm":32.34,"row_group":"qiangji-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图(e)\n(1) 比较图(b)中 P、Q、M、N 四点之间的电势大小关系；\n(2)阱内同时存在沿+z方向的匀强磁场,磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" .氢离子在xOy平面内,做以O点为圆心,半径为a的匀速圆周运动,速率 "},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{B_{0}qa}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,求氢离子轨迹所在处的场强大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{xy}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(3)阱内施加沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"+z"},{"type":"text","value":" 方向的匀强磁场，磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，且阱内电场满足： "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda = \\frac{B_1^2q}{4m}, E_{xy} = \\frac{B_1^2q}{4m}r"},{"type":"text","value":" ("},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" 为到 "},{"type":"math","value":"z"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的距离). 若在坐标 "},{"type":"math","value":"(-a,0,a)"},{"type":"text","value":" 处有一速度沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向的氢离子，速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{B_1qa}{2m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求该氢离子经过 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面的坐标；\n(4)在(3)的基础上,仅调节 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":" ,使得氢离子的运动轨迹如图(e)所示,求 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":" 值."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(12 分)(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi_{M}=\\varphi_{P}=\\varphi_{Q}>\\varphi_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(2)洛伦兹力和电场力提供向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}vq-E_{xy}q=\\frac{mv^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{xy}=\\frac{B_{0}^{2}qa}{4m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)在水平方向上,离子受到洛伦兹力和幅向电场力,合外力与所需向心力有"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}vq-E_{xy}q=\\frac{mv^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{B_{1}^{2}q^{2}a}{4m}=\\frac{mv^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"两者相等,所以水平方向上离子做以 z 轴为圆心,半径为 a 的圆周运动.其周期满足"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{xy}=\\frac{2\\pi a}{v}=\\frac{2\\pi a}{\\frac{B_{1}qa}{2m}}=\\frac{4\\pi m}{B_{1}q}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n在竖直面上，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{z}=-Eq=-\\lambda qz"},{"type":"text","value":"，离子xOy平面上方时，受到向下的电场力；在xOy平面下方时，受到向上的电场力，大小与偏离xOy平面的距离成正比.\n可知竖直方向上在做简谐运动.（1分）\n其周期满足"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{z}=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{\\lambda q}}=\\frac{4\\pi m}{B_{1}q}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"T _ {x y} = T _ {z}"},{"type":"text","value":"每次离子回到平衡位置平面时的经过时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{1}{4}T_{z}+k\\times\\frac{1}{2}T_{z}"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3d56edf16d3dfba066e02b521e7bffefa57c84fa6d868a3af923488bb445174c.png","width":201,"height":184,"width_mm":25.4},{"type":"text","value":"水平方向上离子转过"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"或者"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"圆弧（如图所示）\n此时离子的坐标为"},{"type":"math","value":"(0,a,0)"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"(0,-a,0)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(4)由图知,此时竖直方向上简谐运动的周期为水平方向圆周运动的周期的两倍,故"},{"type":"math","value":"2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{\\lambda q}}=2\\cdot\\frac{4\\pi m}{B_{1}q}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda=\\frac{B_{1}^{2}q}{16m}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"}]}}]}
